Package: floaties
Title: Swimlane and Waterfall Plots for Multiple Plotting Engines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Vedha", "Viyash", , "vedha@appsilon.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws swimlane plots of subject timelines with event markers
    and waterfall plots of per-subject change from baseline, as commonly
    used in clinical trial reporting. Each plot can be rendered with
    'ggplot2', 'plotly' or 'echarts4r', so users can choose between static
    and interactive graphics.
